Show the session's tailnet name in the composer workspace bar.

Reads the omnigent.tailscale_host session label and session.tailscale events,
and renders the Tailscale mark and the runner Pod's MagicDNS short name
(omnigent-e1dcab9b) after the working directory, as a clickable label that
copies the full name (omnigent-e1dcab9b.tail1234.ts.net) and briefly confirms it.
Pairs with the server patch 0003-tailscale-host.patch. Applies after
0001-composer-rate-limits.patch.
Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

